{
 "total": 75.643,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "l01",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "hook",
   "show": "Morning, Claude! Please tell me you've got some content ideas for today.",
   "start": 0.15,
   "end": 3.94
  },
  {
   "id": "l02",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "hook",
   "show": "Today? I've prepared a whole month!",
   "start": 4.22,
   "end": 6.19
  },
  {
   "id": "l03",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "problem",
   "show": "Wait, a whole month? Researching, writing, editing and scheduling usually takes me forever!",
   "start": 6.97,
   "end": 11.926
  },
  {
   "id": "l04",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "problem",
   "show": "That's exactly the workflow we can automate.",
   "start": 12.206,
   "end": 14.685
  },
  {
   "id": "l05",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "research",
   "show": "But where do you get the ideas?",
   "start": 14.965,
   "end": 16.417
  },
  {
   "id": "l06",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "research",
   "show": "From the sources and research tools you connect. I can organize relevant topics and turn them into a content plan.",
   "start": 16.697,
   "end": 24.633
  },
  {
   "id": "l07",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "calendar",
   "show": "Next, I prepare scripts, captions and a content calendar. Connected production tools can help create the actual media.",
   "start": 25.163,
   "end": 33.274
  },
  {
   "id": "l08",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "calendar",
   "show": "All organized in one place?",
   "start": 33.554,
   "end": 35.204
  },
  {
   "id": "l09",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "calendar",
   "show": "Exactly!",
   "start": 35.484,
   "end": 36.31
  },
  {
   "id": "l10",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "connectors",
   "show": "How do you connect everything together?",
   "start": 36.59,
   "end": 38.402
  },
  {
   "id": "l11",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "connectors",
   "show": "With the right connectors, skills and automation workflows. They give me access to the tools you've authorized.",
   "start": 38.682,
   "end": 45.885
  },
  {
   "id": "l12",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "analytics",
   "show": "And can you check how my videos are performing?",
   "start": 46.415,
   "end": 48.618
  },
  {
   "id": "l13",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "analytics",
   "show": "If you connect the appropriate analytics tools, I can help review views, engagement and which topics perform best.",
   "start": 48.898,
   "end": 56.632
  },
  {
   "id": "l14",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "approval",
   "show": "So you don't need me anymore?",
   "start": 57.162,
   "end": 58.484
  },
  {
   "id": "l15",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "approval",
   "show": "Of course I do! You're the creator. You approve the content, and I help with the repetitive work.",
   "start": 59.364,
   "end": 65.534
  },
  {
   "id": "l16",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "closing",
   "show": "Less repetitive work. More time to create. I like that!",
   "start": 65.814,
   "end": 68.95
  },
  {
   "id": "l17",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "closing",
   "show": "Now, what should we create next?",
   "start": 69.23,
   "end": 70.976
  },
  {
   "id": "l18",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "closing",
   "show": "Save this video if you want to build your own AI content assistant.",
   "start": 71.256,
   "end": 74.863
  }
 ],
